 the key and bring forth the Rozen Maidens, and a chance to fix the shattered remains of his own world.\n\nFor Jun-who-did-not-win, the messages from his younger self represent a beacon of light in his mediocre and disappointing existence. When the adult Jun discovers a box with parts and building instructions for a familiar red-dressed doll, the goal becomes clear: revive Shinku in his world to save both worlds from succumbing to the evils of Kirakisho, the seventh Rozen Maiden in a desperate search for a body and master. The Alice Game will become a war of dimensions as two worlds hang by the threads of fate.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Battle Royale","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"College","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Hikikomori","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Rozen Maiden: Zurückspulen","english":"Rozen Maiden: Zurückspulen","native":"ローゼンメイデン (2013)","romaji":"Rozen Maiden (2013)","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ローゼンメイデン"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"新蔷薇少女"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Rozen Maiden Zurückspulen"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"蔷薇少女 第三季"}]},"trailer":{"id":"EtBxEYU1GFQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"